moire Hamiltonians use k in 1/nm; the atomic models below are the SM-notebook \
models with q = a0 k. Moire period TA = 1/55 (55 nm).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"93f19510-9e08-554f-8858-b20fdbc07c40"],
,

